        <mxCell id="c83" parent="L_base" style="text;html=1;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;" value="Legend: solid = CAN frame (ID | period | deadline); dashed = in-node handoff; dots on a box = chains through it (blue brake, green steering, orange blinker, red error). Drawn for R4.8 scenario (c): N1 off bus B, N3 off bus A. Relay boxes = N2's RELAY task (priority 1): it forwards the first copy of every N1/N3 frame onto the other bus with the relayed flag (0x10). Blue path = relayed brake chain: 0x010 on A → RELAY (N2) → 0x010 on B → CAN_RX_B → DRIVE (N3)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="1300" x="44" y="1490" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
